    "terrainName": "air-range",
    "description": "What: five Ace F-16s ('Viper 1'\u2026'Viper 5') each against a Rookie MiG ('Fulcrum 1'\u2026'Fulcrum 5'), lapses OFF, each pair in its own arena 30 km from the next and starting differently \u2014 the design's five seeds (CE-10004 / CE-10005, AC-12, R-10021). Each pair merges, then fights; skill alone decides: reaction, the g, the shot discipline AND the defence (a Rookie turns level and drops two decoys, an Ace drags far shots). Judge: at least four of the five Rookies are shot down inside 300 s, and never more than one Ace is lost."
